WEBVTT

00:29.150 --> 00:30.400
Delicious!

00:37.450 --> 00:40.350
Chao, I'm going to see Mom.

01:07.990 --> 01:11.870
Hello, is this Suzuki-san's cell phone?

01:14.180 --> 01:14.910
Yes.

01:15.310 --> 01:19.600
I am Hara Magic Office's Hara Seiichirou.

01:21.030 --> 01:21.530
Yes.

01:22.970 --> 01:27.010
From now, Suzuki Sora-san will be doing her training program here.

01:28.660 --> 01:29.310
Ah no.

01:29.850 --> 01:33.190
I think the Magic Bureau will contact you too.

01:34.430 --> 01:35.010
Okay.

01:36.280 --> 01:37.290
Thanks.

01:37.580 --> 01:38.420
Likewise.

01:38.490 --> 01:39.270
Thank you.

01:41.230 --> 01:41.820
Later.

01:48.910 --> 01:50.540
That girl from Hokkaido?

01:50.920 --> 01:53.250
Yes, I will be caring for her.

01:55.380 --> 01:56.840
Suzuki Sora...

01:57.920 --> 01:59.230
what kind of girl is she?

03:46.380 --> 03:48.830
Mom!

03:50.770 --> 03:54.150
Your lunch!

03:55.880 --> 03:58.380
Mom!

04:01.490 --> 04:02.550
Huh?

04:03.270 --> 04:05.030
Isn't that Sora-chan?

04:05.690 --> 04:06.520
Over there.

04:08.190 --> 04:09.920
Hey, Saeko-san,

04:11.310 --> 04:13.440
Sora-chan came all the way out here.

04:13.980 --> 04:15.960
Huh, what's up?

04:16.340 --> 04:17.830
What?  Sora?!

04:18.230 --> 04:20.310
Yuusaki-san, please stop for a moment.

04:22.610 --> 04:23.700
Sora!

04:23.990 --> 04:25.450
Big news!

04:26.600 --> 04:28.410
Sora!

04:29.190 --> 04:30.490
Mom?

04:32.600 --> 04:33.870
Sora!

04:39.430 --> 04:40.480
Mom!

04:41.280 --> 04:43.360
Sora, the training...

04:43.570 --> 04:45.590
you've been accepted for the training.

04:46.310 --> 04:49.220
The Magic Bureau just contacted me.

04:49.220 --> 04:50.260
I see.

04:49.500 --> 04:52.570
They called me on the cell phone.

04:52.790 --> 04:54.740
Sora, isn't that great?

04:55.420 --> 04:56.520
Mom!

04:56.760 --> 04:58.280
Mom!

05:03.480 --> 05:04.370
Sora.

05:04.610 --> 05:05.840
Mom!

05:10.930 --> 05:13.650
Sora, you'll get dirty.

05:15.990 --> 05:17.120
Such a surprise, huh?

05:21.090 --> 05:22.560
Are you crying, Sora?

05:23.750 --> 05:25.110
I'm not crying.

05:27.920 --> 05:29.080
I see.

05:31.450 --> 05:34.300
Well, I'm off to go see Dad.

05:34.590 --> 05:36.290
Ah, off you go.

05:41.840 --> 05:45.710
Sora-chan is such a happy girl.

05:54.320 --> 05:56.460
Sora, work hard.

06:33.780 --> 06:34.810
Father.

06:36.420 --> 06:38.520
I was accepted into the training program.

06:38.960 --> 06:40.690
I will become a Mage.

06:41.840 --> 06:42.850
Father.

06:54.610 --> 06:56.130
It's a promise,

06:57.790 --> 06:58.850
just wait...

07:04.560 --> 07:05.620
Father.

07:11.910 --> 07:13.680
I'm sorry for not being able to keep in touch.

07:13.720 --> 07:17.900
Many things have happened, I just received your message.

07:18.420 --> 07:21.710
I see, what's going on?

07:23.560 --> 07:25.630
I was accepted into the training program.

07:25.630 --> 07:27.180
The magic one?

07:28.310 --> 07:29.730
Isn't that great, Sora?

07:30.010 --> 07:30.920
Congratulations!

07:32.450 --> 07:34.950
Tomorrow, I'll be heading to Tokyo.

07:35.730 --> 07:37.190
What did you do that for?

07:36.620 --> 07:38.840
I see, it's going to be lonely.

07:40.690 --> 07:42.020
Give me the phone.

07:42.550 --> 07:46.400
Yoshiko wants you to come get some fresh milk from him this morning.

07:46.400 --> 07:47.690
Shut up, Dad!

07:47.690 --> 07:49.940
I'm having a very important conversation right now.

07:49.940 --> 07:51.370
Sora-chan!

07:51.790 --> 07:53.850
What did you want to talk about?

07:54.640 --> 07:55.970
Sora, where are you right now?

07:56.420 --> 07:57.480
At the station.

07:58.600 --> 08:00.020
Then see you at our old place.

08:00.030 --> 08:00.950
Okay.

08:00.950 --> 08:03.160
Are you talking with Sora-chan again?

08:03.540 --> 08:05.050
It's always Sora-chan, Sora-chan.

08:04.800 --> 08:05.810
Shush!

08:06.520 --> 08:08.210
Ah, she hung up.

08:10.700 --> 08:12.000
Okay then.

08:38.930 --> 08:41.450
When did you find out... about the training program?

08:41.720 --> 08:45.350
A while ago, they called my Mom's cell phone.

08:46.040 --> 08:49.100
Will you be going to Tokyo alone?

08:49.540 --> 08:50.180
Yes.

08:52.920 --> 08:54.450
Would you like to come along, Michiru?

08:56.830 --> 08:59.050
But I'm not a Mage.

09:00.050 --> 09:01.100
I see.

09:04.840 --> 09:06.890
Michiru, what did you want to talk about?

09:10.120 --> 09:13.440
I have an unrequited love...

09:13.810 --> 09:14.570
No way!

09:14.570 --> 09:15.370
It's true.

09:15.670 --> 09:16.490
Who?

09:18.260 --> 09:19.310
Toyama-kun.

09:20.400 --> 09:23.370
He'll be leaving during the summer break.

09:23.730 --> 09:25.920
But didn't he just transfer in?

09:27.070 --> 09:28.920
He told me so.

09:31.650 --> 09:33.040
It can't be helped.

09:40.350 --> 09:45.190
Michiru liking Toyama-kun... I never realized.

09:45.740 --> 09:47.980
Because it's one-sided.

09:49.160 --> 09:51.460
It's better if I forget about it.

09:52.580 --> 09:54.690
Is this okay, Michiru?

09:55.740 --> 09:56.570
But you know,

09:57.000 --> 10:02.340
Toyama-kun wanted to see Biei's winter with me.

10:03.910 --> 10:06.510
I was happy.

10:08.370 --> 10:09.020
I'm sorry.

10:10.420 --> 10:11.600
Michiru!

10:13.590 --> 10:14.450
Sora?

10:15.300 --> 10:16.910
Uh... wait...

10:17.830 --> 10:21.090
You've got to take a chance and tell him your feelings.

10:21.090 --> 10:22.210
Sora!

10:22.220 --> 10:23.710
That hurts!

10:22.910 --> 10:23.850
Let's go!

10:23.800 --> 10:25.170
S-Sora!

10:25.480 --> 10:27.030
But...

10:32.840 --> 10:35.720
Then old man Sadake's place at 8 PM.

10:38.370 --> 10:39.350
Hey, Sora.

10:39.650 --> 10:40.500
Hmm?

10:41.240 --> 10:44.390
Is this really okay when you have such an important training program soon?

10:45.820 --> 10:47.600
My dad told me,

10:48.600 --> 10:52.940
"Use magic when it is necessary."

10:53.480 --> 10:54.440
Sora.

10:55.770 --> 10:58.170
Ah, Sora-chan, you're here.

10:58.640 --> 11:00.010
Sorry to intrude.

11:00.010 --> 11:01.680
Ah, leaving already?

11:01.680 --> 11:02.650
Dad!

11:03.050 --> 11:05.100
Would you like some milk?

11:05.450 --> 11:08.590
Yes, I took a lot for Mom.

11:08.590 --> 11:09.980
I see, I see.

11:09.980 --> 11:11.330
Then, later.

11:12.740 --> 11:14.710
Old man, see you later.

11:15.670 --> 11:17.240
Bye bye, Sora-chan.

11:19.290 --> 11:20.640
Sora!

11:21.080 --> 11:22.780
Thank you!

11:27.820 --> 11:31.190
She sure is a lovely girl.

11:45.500 --> 11:46.550
Now, now.

11:46.550 --> 11:48.050
Eat well.

11:51.100 --> 11:54.130
Now now, there is plenty for you.

11:58.280 --> 12:01.220
Then, I leave Mom in your hands.

12:12.110 --> 12:13.610
Don't forget to wash your hands!

12:13.950 --> 12:14.920
Okay.

12:19.510 --> 12:21.170
Wow, looks delicious!

12:21.170 --> 12:23.710
There are so many of my favorites!

12:24.060 --> 12:27.980
Perhaps tomorrow, you might not have anymore of your favorite foods.

12:28.280 --> 12:30.100
Thanks, Mom.

12:31.590 --> 12:33.050
So delicious!

12:33.270 --> 12:37.030
Sora, eat as much as you can.

12:44.030 --> 12:46.290
Work hard at your training.

12:47.500 --> 12:49.590
But don't overdo it.

12:51.640 --> 12:54.780
Obey your teacher and make sure you listen well.

12:57.520 --> 13:00.180
Also, from now on,

13:01.090 --> 13:03.430
got to trial and error.

13:04.480 --> 13:06.250
Don't lose heart.

13:08.190 --> 13:09.110
Mom!

13:09.380 --> 13:13.000
I was right, this Miso soup has tofu and mushrooms!

13:16.010 --> 13:18.130
I'll be leaving tomorrow so I will be seeing Michiru for a bit.

13:18.250 --> 13:20.230
Are you all prepared?

13:20.230 --> 13:21.260
Not yet.

13:21.390 --> 13:23.350
Don't come back late.

13:23.600 --> 13:24.720
I know.

13:25.440 --> 13:26.700
Want to take a light?

13:26.880 --> 13:28.160
It's all right.

13:28.160 --> 13:29.410
I'm off.

13:42.640 --> 13:43.550
Is that you Sora?

13:43.660 --> 13:45.610
Sorry I'm late.

13:47.200 --> 13:51.210
Sora, I'm nervous.

13:51.760 --> 13:54.490
Michiru, you've got to trial and error!

13:55.040 --> 13:56.980
Don't lose heart.

13:58.730 --> 14:03.700
You have to be true to your feelings...

14:04.000 --> 14:05.200
how do I say it...

14:05.780 --> 14:06.820
That's right.

14:07.160 --> 14:11.360
I should tell Toyoma-kun all about my feelings.

14:12.090 --> 14:15.170
If I don't, I will regret it.

14:15.930 --> 14:16.950
Michiru...

14:17.580 --> 14:18.950
It's about time.

14:19.230 --> 14:20.740
I'm going.

14:21.800 --> 14:22.600
Michiru.

14:24.450 --> 14:26.110
Good luck, Michiru.

14:29.160 --> 14:32.530
Sato, are you here?

14:32.740 --> 14:33.650
Sato?

14:35.160 --> 14:36.100
Toyama-kun...

14:36.410 --> 14:37.830
What's going on?

14:37.830 --> 14:39.300
Why did you call me out here?

14:40.380 --> 14:43.270
You're talking like the locals of Hokkaido now.

14:43.270 --> 14:44.320
Really?

14:44.410 --> 14:45.900
I don't think I'm that good yet.

14:47.590 --> 14:49.170
But aren't you already good?

14:49.480 --> 14:53.030
Well, I want to be better.

14:53.740 --> 14:57.230
So this is what it looks like inside.

14:58.700 --> 15:04.530
I want to tell you my real feelings.

15:04.810 --> 15:05.420
Huh?

15:07.700 --> 15:08.530
All right.

15:12.130 --> 15:13.570
For Michiru...

15:16.010 --> 15:18.740
a white world.

15:30.810 --> 15:32.830
Sato... this is...

15:34.140 --> 15:35.770
amazing.

15:36.930 --> 15:37.810
This is...

15:38.960 --> 15:39.730
snow?

15:41.580 --> 15:44.270
Sora summoned it for me.

15:44.510 --> 15:45.490
Suzuki did?

15:46.160 --> 15:46.990
I see.

15:47.630 --> 15:48.880
It's magic.

15:50.200 --> 15:51.690
But why...

15:51.130 --> 15:55.590
Toyama-kun, you wanted to see the winter of Biei.

15:56.790 --> 15:59.570
I like the beauty of winter.

16:02.840 --> 16:03.790
It's beautiful.

16:04.980 --> 16:07.990
I like you, Toyama-kun.

16:08.510 --> 16:09.120
Huh?

16:12.240 --> 16:17.280
During the fall the wheat that is planted is called Akiko.

16:18.050 --> 16:18.960
Akiko?

16:23.080 --> 16:29.580
Akiko is a wheat that can live under the winter snow.

16:30.620 --> 16:34.730
They wait for the spring that is after the long winter.

16:35.730 --> 16:41.730
For me, the feeling of the Akiko are very important.

16:44.360 --> 16:47.750
Then the both of us... I'm glad we both saw the snow.

17:03.290 --> 17:05.720
Oh my, aren't we in high spirits.

17:06.340 --> 17:08.180
Did something good happen?

17:13.080 --> 17:15.260
A try and catch happened.

17:16.080 --> 17:19.860
Oh really, what kind of catch?

17:21.640 --> 17:23.530
Something really warm.

17:24.720 --> 17:27.080
But Michiru was the one with the catch.

17:27.600 --> 17:29.550
I see, I see.

17:30.060 --> 17:31.380
That's right.

17:34.960 --> 17:35.800
Sora.

17:37.280 --> 17:40.370
Is it okay if I leave your change of clothes here?

17:43.640 --> 17:44.560
Sora?

17:46.040 --> 17:47.870
Mom is coming in to bathe too.

17:47.870 --> 17:49.370
Huh, why?!

17:49.370 --> 17:50.980
It's all right.

17:53.650 --> 17:54.840
I'm getting out!

18:05.370 --> 18:06.830
That felt good.

18:08.830 --> 18:09.650
Mail?

18:09.920 --> 18:10.970
From Michiru perhaps?

18:28.750 --> 18:30.560
Isn't that great, Michiru?

18:31.690 --> 18:32.830
I see.

18:35.750 --> 18:39.580
I don't have a boyfriend.

18:45.200 --> 18:46.250
Love...

18:57.730 --> 19:00.570
Sora, Yuusaki-chan is here!

19:00.570 --> 19:01.680
Come on!

19:02.570 --> 19:03.580
Okay!

19:05.840 --> 19:08.870
Dad, I'm leaving now.

19:11.080 --> 19:12.890
Do you have everything you need?

19:13.230 --> 19:15.150
Trial and error.

19:15.490 --> 19:18.250
Umm, isn't that the wrong thing?

19:24.340 --> 19:28.420
Yuusaki-chan, sorry for this. Please take her to the Asahikawa airport.

19:28.750 --> 19:30.010
Oh, it's all right.

19:31.690 --> 19:34.290
Sora, take care of yourself.

19:35.540 --> 19:36.530
Mom.

19:36.740 --> 19:37.480
What's the matter?

19:38.330 --> 19:41.110
Wouldn't it be good if I had a brother or sister?

19:41.110 --> 19:41.740
Idiot.

19:43.000 --> 19:44.780
Give it your all.

19:45.210 --> 19:47.110
Make new friends.

19:47.470 --> 19:49.460
Go out and see the world.

19:49.610 --> 19:50.260
Okay.

19:52.380 --> 19:53.360
I'm leaving now.

19:59.510 --> 20:00.190
Sora!

20:02.200 --> 20:03.270
Sora!

20:06.310 --> 20:08.540
Sora!

20:11.010 --> 20:12.830
Tokyo, huh?

20:13.540 --> 20:16.110
Are you excited?

20:43.380 --> 20:44.670
Oh, it's Michiru.

20:53.870 --> 20:59.290
Ma'am, please stow away your cell phone.

21:01.220 --> 21:02.610
I'm sorry.

21:27.550 --> 21:30.920
I wonder what kind of place Tokyo is.

23:05.630 --> 23:07.110
It's a new city.

23:07.440 --> 23:09.140
New people to meet.

23:09.710 --> 23:12.870
And also, new things to begin.

23:13.730 --> 23:15.300
Next time, Tokyo.

23:16.200 --> 23:17.610
Tokyo...

23:17.990 --> 23:19.790
is soooo hot.
